{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-14",
  "title": "“我们”",
  "storyCode": "13-16",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cf4fef4e208ea34dfd800e298471fbacdb5544b8a416f229661ceeecf0752fd6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "好消息，还是坏消息？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷德",
      "text": "好消息是，那个作坊确实还完整，它藏在森林里，没被萨卡兹或者大公爵抢下当作兵站。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷德",
      "text": "坏消息是，里面有人居住，我们看到了灯光。我靠近了那里，表明了身份，灯光却熄灭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "可能是难民，或者逃兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "熄灭灯光......他们对我们警惕性很高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动战士",
      "text": "我们做好准备了，我们的战士足以应付大多数的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "不，先不着急，熄灭灯光也可能仅仅是出于谨慎，或者害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "别太早下定论。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "况且，雷德背着那么长一把刀，任谁都会加倍小心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我去吧，我去和他们谈谈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "你一个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "够了，人越多，他们越紧张。况且，如果那些人真的有敌意，也不会因为我们去了几个人而变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "南边的天空从前几天开始一直是殷红色，珀茜瓦尔他们之前还发现过一座奇怪的法阵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我们必须抓紧时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "......这有一定风险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "但我们从切尔诺伯格走出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "我们会在外围准备好接应，随时突围。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "那边在被维多利亚的整合运动占领之前，是个私酒厂，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我已经闻到酒精的味道了。罗曼内奇会喜欢的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你好，有人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你好，我叫Guard，我们的队伍就在附近，你们之前已经发现他们了，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "别紧张，我们没有敌意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "这个作坊曾经是维多利亚整合运动的制药工坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "这里曾经给很多伦蒂尼姆附近的感染者带去了希望，这里的药物甚至在伦蒂尼姆那些工业区下水道里的工人们之间流通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "不论你们是谁，你们都知道，这场战争在催生大量的感染者，比以往多得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我们想要重新运转这里，这能帮助到很多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "既然你们已经占据了这里......\n我们需要你们的协助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我们可以提供药物，或者其他物资，这是一场合理的交易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动？",
      "text": "整合运动，嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "这身衣服......你是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动？",
      "text": "梅斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "进来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "别看了，让开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你是这里的负责人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "这里归我管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我们找个没人的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "就这儿吧，平常没人来这儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "所以，你是整合运动，货真价实的整合运动，你们从北方来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "......乌萨斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "是的，乌萨斯，哥伦比亚，现在我们到了维多利亚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不近。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你的这身衣服是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我......自己用床单改的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我以前遇到过一批乌萨斯人，他们说你们就是这副打扮。我应该没弄错标志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "似乎有点大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "......你是来笑话我的手艺的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "所以你才管住了这里，毕竟你穿了身凶名在外的“整合运动”的衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "直入主题吧，我的时间不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你们想重新运转这间作坊？想用这些罐子制药？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "是的，如果这里重新被整合运动掌控的消息能在周围传开......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "这里的情况比你们想象的复杂，这里什么人都有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "每天感染者和非感染者打的架就已经闹得我心力交瘁了，给感染者造药？你干脆直接炸了这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "他们之间的平衡很难维持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你是个整合运动，对吧？起码自称是个整合运动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "大概吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你们遇到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "还能是什么，无家可归的感染者，战争难民，失去了一切的人，我们总需要一个能够遮风避雨的屋檐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我和另外几个感染者是最先来的。我们发现了这里有间破房子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "后来人越来越多，也来了些......很不老实的家伙。现在，我们不收外人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "能看到你们，整合运动的同伴，我很高兴。但我不想让这里的人怀疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "怀疑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "怀疑现在我和你正在密谋清理掉我们之中的那些非感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不管是不是你骗我们开门的借口，我们可以交换物资。但在此之上的......免谈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......这里还有很多非感染者，那么我理解你的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "但我仍然建议你能和这里的人们商量一下再做决定，只要这里的药物生产能够重启，我们可以达成长期的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不，不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "现在，离开吧。见到你很高兴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你们要打下这里，也可以。只要你们打得下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "喂，整合运动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "塔露拉在你们的队伍里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我听说，她有一座移动城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "她的移动城市里，只接受感染者吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "没感染的人，能去那里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我听整......以前路过的商队说起过，那里是个好地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我——我们这里，有一些境况不太好的人，出身荒野的流民，再无亲人的孤儿，说起整合运动的城市，大家都眉飞色舞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "......可是，你们只和感染者站在一起，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......城市？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "可能有一些误会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "梅斯！你到底知不知道他们干的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "是不是你让他们干的！你疯了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "他们——那帮蠢货！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "那个人也许是个正在这里打仗的士兵！或者是个什么会惹来麻烦的大人物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "也许，两个小时之后，就会有一大批武装到牙齿的萨卡兹把我们都杀光！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "到底怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "你......你也是个和梅斯一样的整合运动？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "都是你，你们的人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "那些感染者，在仓库里打死了一个萨卡兹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "该死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "他......他也是感染者，会炸，对吧？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "我们得把那家伙处理掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我需要去看看情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那，快点！你应该能帮得上忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "他......他死了。萨卡兹也没有很强壮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "给......他身上的药，和硬面包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的感染者",
      "text": "活该。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的感染者",
      "text": "你！你是整合运动，对不对？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的感染者",
      "text": "之前梅斯一直不告诉我们加入你们的办法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你们为什么打他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "他胁迫了你们吗？他试图攻击你们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的感染者",
      "text": "哦，为什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的感染者",
      "text": "萨卡兹烧我们的农场，凌辱我的女儿的时候，问过为什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......他不是军人，他不是什么从卡兹戴尔来的杀人魔，他确实就是个在这片战场上倒卖东西的流浪者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你们......甚至受过他的帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "喂，怎么回事？他也是整合运动？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我“是”整合运动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......那你们应该知道整合运动为什么而战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "当然，你们整合运动是为了帮所有感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "这个被你们折磨至死的人，这个还没来得及给自己起名字的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "他难道不是个感染者吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的感染者",
      "text": "可他是个萨卡兹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "喂，Guard，他的尸体......在发光，他快要崩解了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "离开这里！立刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "跑——跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "梅斯！你们这里怎么处理感染者？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那个房间，那个最里面的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "快，我们得把他扔进去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "该死，该死......我得后退一点，防护......防护，口鼻，还有伤口——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "不行，走，走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你干什么？！你怎么把尸体——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "这里的源石沉积太严重了，这里到底处理过多少感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我......以前——那些年都是在这间房间！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "源石粉尘已经扬起来了，这里已经没办法再承受一次这么猛烈的崩解了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "立刻让所有人离开这里，立刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "......什、什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你听不懂吗？这里的源石环境已经极端不稳定，随时有引发爆炸的可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "离开？去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的难民",
      "text": "外面都是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "别废话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "这些人可是真正的整合运动，他们有一座*维多利亚粗口*的移动城市！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "跑起来，让所有的人都跑起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我已经联络了我们在外围的队伍，他们会接收这里的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "啧，这里的蒸馏器里还有残余的烈酒，如果爆炸，这里会被烧得一干二净！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那个东西——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "喂，梅斯，你要去哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你来干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我正在——唔——帮我扳一下那个操纵杆——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你是这个作坊的成员？但你不是感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "谢谢你没有拆穿我！唔——再用力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你这件整合运动的衣服是哪来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "这里曾经是整合运动的据点，这里死过很多人——我的耐心不多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我——我什么都没做！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "每个人都这么说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我以前是......这里的操作工，那些整合运动占领了酒厂，他们要人为他们操作这些机器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我......只是，那些领主雇来的佣兵突袭了这里，我逃了......我确实不是感染者，我为什么要和那些整合运动一起死在这儿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "那你为什么回来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "为什么要回来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "因为我无处可去！该死，还能有什么原因，沦落到在私酒厂里卖命的人，还能有什么地方可以去？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我没感染，可我有的时候，宁愿自己是个整合运动！他们，他们起码有可以反抗的东西，他们起码有个目标！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "再用力——这操纵杆，卡住了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "先把这玩意——卸料口的开关打开，曾经在这里的那些整合运动，他们留在这里的原料还剩下不少！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那医生告诉过我，这是他们尝试了很久的，最廉价的止痛剂配方，只能止痛，但也够了，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "用这个......我能换个真正的整合运动资格吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我想......我也许可以在你们的移动城市里，分间房子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我们并没有移动城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "可是，那些整合运动都说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "可是你们......可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "......哈哈......也是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那可是......移动城市，一座城市，我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "带好这些草药，我们马上离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你其实不用申请加入整合运动，只要你愿意和我们并肩作战，你就已经是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "可......我不是感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "想要反抗的人也未必只有感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "还有，我需要你帮助我指认那些杀了那个萨卡兹的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "他们需要受到惩罚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "跑起来，快点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "前面就是出口了，加快速度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "啊！我的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "拿去......收好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "出口就在前面，这次别再撒了，有些花瓣可能......被我捏碎了，把它们给一个叫九的人，她有办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "别再磨蹭了，快点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "九，雷德，珀茜瓦尔，塔露拉，呃哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我不确定你们找到我的时候，我有没有被火烧成灰，但愿这个录音机能留得下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你们说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我们为所有的“感染者”而战吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "哪怕他们是无耻者，是上位者，甚至......是帝王？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "或者说......我们所团结的人，我们希望与之并肩披荆斩棘的人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "只有感染者吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "只有......他们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
